>> title: Kale and White Bean Pasta
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, vegan, quick
>> time: 25 minutes

Cook @pasta{400%g} in salted water until al dente.

Meanwhile fry @garlic{3%cloves}, sliced, with @chilli flakes{0.5%tsp} in @olive oil{3%tbsp} in a #pan{}.

Add @kale{300%g}, shredded, with a splash of pasta water and cook for ~{6%minutes}.

Stir in @white beans{480%g} and @lemon{1} zest, then toss with the drained pasta and @breadcrumbs{40%g}.
